Package: preJCERBGVAR
Type: Package
Title: Development Tools for Bayesian Global Vector Autoregressions
Version: 0.1.1.9000
Authors@R: person("motohiro", "watanabe", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "watanabemotosan@gmail.com")
Description: Conditional country-level Bayesian global vector autoregressions
    with matrix-normal inverse-Wishart priors and independent posterior draws.
    Provides synthetic data with known dynamics, linked world systems, selected
    impulse responses and single-shock sign restrictions. Explicitly distinguishes
    conditional country inference from a simultaneous world likelihood.
    Also provides selected-vector impulse responses from an unchanged fitted
    'BGVAR' posterior, with explicit shock-definition compatibility.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats, graphics, grDevices, parallel, utils
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), knitr, rmarkdown, roxygen2, pkgdown, BGVAR
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
URL: https://github.com/motti6/jcerBGVAR
BugReports: https://github.com/motti6/jcerBGVAR/issues
